{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57914","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57914","key":"SV-11420","fields":{"summary":"Tech View – Row Text 13 px and Progress Percentage 11 px at Every Density","parent":{"id":"56393","key":"SV-10049","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56393","fields":{"summary":"Density in Tech View and Board View","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}},"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62422","id":"62422","filename":"C96990-1-tech-view-row-text-13px.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T05:43:35.240-0500","size":139211,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62422","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62422"}],"description":"h2. Description\n\n*Tech View's row text should be 14 px at every density, and the progress percentage should be 12 px.* On staging the row text is 13 px and the percentage 11 px, at Compact, Regular and Comfortable alike.\n\nFor example,\n\n* the work order number, customer, unit, VIN, advisor, lead and price in a Tech View row are 13 px\n* the \"0%\" beside the progress bar is 11 px\n* Board View's card text, by contrast, is 14 px\n\nh2. Steps to Reproduce\n\n# Sign in to staging as an Admin and check the top bar shows *Staging Heavy Duty - 9919*.\n# Open *Work Orders*, click the *All* tab, type a customer in *Search* (for example {{ZZAUTOTEST F1 Compact Text}}) and click *Tech View*.\n# Click the density button and choose *Regular*, then *Compact*, then *Comfortable*, and each time check the size of the text in a row (for example with the browser's inspector, Computed > font-size).\n#* Row text: 13 px at every density.\n#* The percentage beside the progress bar: 11 px at every density.\n\n*Actual Result:*\n\n* Row text 13 px and percentage 11 px at every density.\n\n*Expected Result:*\n\n* Row text 14 px at every density; the percentage 12 px at every density.\n\nh2. Screenshots\n\n!C96990-1-tech-view-row-text-13px.png|width=1962,height=1084!\n\nh2. Environment\n\n* *Build:* {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}} on [staging|https://app.staging.shopview.com/workorders] · *Location:* Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 · *User:* Admin, example work order {{S2-35534}} · seen 16 Oct 2026\n\nh2. Sources\n\n* [PRD – Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (Confluence page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026), S6-R4:\nRow and card text is 14px at every density; Compact never shrinks it. Text the design sets at 12px at every density, such as column header labels (S2-R21), the progress percentage and secondary lines, stays 12px.\n* The column header labels' size is already reported in [SV-11321] and is not repeated here.\n\nh2. Test case\n\n* [C96990 Row and card text stays the same size at every density|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/96990]","issuelinks":[{"id":"33599","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33599","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"56393","key":"SV-10049","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56393","fields":{"summary":"Density in Tech View and Board View","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","d